{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Naftuli.</b> A noun from the nif'al binyan. Its meaning is like a person who wrestles with another and twists to defeat him in order to bring him down. So too תתפל (2 Samuel 22:27). The meaning of 'the Elohim' is: for the glory of HaShem I gave my maidservant, or HaShem helped me in my wrestling."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:22.019424219Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}